// Mac App Store build: App Sandbox (target settings in project.yml), Apple Distribution signature and the
// Mac App Store provisioning profile. The team comes from Signing.local.xcconfig; AppStore.local.xcconfig
// can override the identity or the profile name.
#include "Base.xcconfig"

CODE_SIGN_STYLE = Manual
CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY = Apple Distribution
PROVISIONING_PROFILE_SPECIFIER = Pinxel Mac App Store

#include? "AppStore.local.xcconfig"
